ay he didn't want to go anywhere near Earth was rumored to be for funzies) is a Ulgan named Frank. Found Regret in the throws of Torment after his Genitor abandoned him and help in become a Originist and stabilize his Humors. His Genitor will be known as Prime, and is a bit of a perfectionist amongst the Wretched, which is saying a loooot in regards to Frankensteins.<br /> <br /> *Update: I posted an intro. Very self-reflected but think I got his internal voice quite well. Someone who every much wants to understand the world around him but has trouble expressing it. Feel free to react any way you want, I left it as open to better fit the scene. ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Update 01-02-2017, 10:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T04:51:16-08:00","id":1026451,"title":"","content":"Wait, where's Scout's sheet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"